WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
A steel graver presses into brushed brass. A thin shaving curls up as the tool cuts the H.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:07.000
The graver follows the curve of the ampersand. On a ball vise, the inscription grows to read Harbor & Pine CPA.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.625
A hand wipes wax from the brass, leaving the engraved letters dark.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:12.000
A screwdriver tightens the nameplate against brick. The view pulls back to the plaque beside a blue door.
